- Flushing
- Sunnyside
- Ditmars

Let $v_i$ be the Value (development benefit) and $w_i$ be the Weight (resource requirement) for area $i$ as given below:

| ProductName         | Value | Weight |
|---------------------|-------|--------|
| Queens              | 469   | 954    |
| Brooklyn            | 290   | 650    |
| Manhattan           | 236   | 961    |
| Bronx               | 235   | 950    |
